    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "The non-overlapping domain decompositions can then be derived by approximating the transmission problem. For example, consider the classic Robin–Robin method, first introduced in [27]. By taking linear combinations of the last two equations in (2), one has the equivalent Robin conditions"
